      <p><strong>ECOCRUCEROS</strong> invites you to enjoy an unforgettable 3.5-hour voyage just 30 minutes from central Lima, aboard a comfortable and safe cruiser yacht equipped with sophisticated navigation gear, an experienced crew, restrooms and other amenities.</p>
      <p>The Palomino Islands tour is one of the most enjoyable in Lima: the voyage offers a spectacular natural show of the seabirds of the cold Peruvian sea and thousands of sea lions — which you can swim with in their natural habitat.</p>
