<section class="section">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Palomino Islands</p>
    <h2>A natural sanctuary in the Callao sea</h2>
    <p class="lead">A group of islands in the Callao sea, behind San Lorenzo Island, with a population of roughly 5,000 to 8,000 sea lions. The area offers many advantages:</p>
    <ul class="checklist checklist--2" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      <li>Guarantees a significant number of sea lions all year round.</li>
      <li>Its closeness to Lima makes it an ideal nature option: Callao is 30 minutes from the capital.</li>
      <li>A voyage rich in history and ecology among the islands of the area.</li>
      <li>The area offers the chance to swim with the sea lions.</li>
      <li>You'll also see seabirds such as pelicans, boobies, Inca terns and Humboldt penguins.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

